        "text": "Other Bets",
        "text_hash": "cf90ed0b1db4f96e794aa7e2437cc0f837dd38117d650bd6392c43966aeb267e",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000458-61bfa72c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[482]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 458,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Revenues from Other Bets are generated primarily from the sale of autonomous transportation services and internet services.",
        "text_hash": "61bfa72c5a7839b9cb08867f250bfd51dfb72cd434fa3f4caa2f3f645acccefc",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000459-97c33f68",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[484]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 459,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Costs and Expenses",
        "text_hash": "97c33f6800e834cd4eea1a008d1bded7b9d2368738f30be1b3d19e347a1b252d",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000460-d47eaf8c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[485]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 460,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our cost structure has two components: cost of revenues and operating expenses. Our operating expenses include costs related to research and development, sales and marketing, and general and administrative functions. Certain of our costs and expenses, including those associated with the operation of our technical infrastructure as well as components of our operating expenses, are generally less variable in nature and may not correlate to changes in revenue. Additionally, fluctuations in employee compensation expenses may not directly correlate with changes in headcount, due to factors such as annual SBC awards that vest over time.",
        "text_hash": "d47eaf8c602e1d4bc29bfaaded287b9dca2d1348e2b263ba1a4552b43522245e",
        "type": "paragraph"
      }
    ],
